| 3 | 1 | P3 | terminal telemetry fires when no StructureNeeds is composed (`engine.go:1204` → `unresolved.go:221`) | **CONFIRMED — same wording defect, opposite direction** | empty material → event emitted, then `composeStructureNeeds` returns nil (`structure.go:1624`). | a7a6edac | Same contract fix. Emission deliberately NOT suppressed on empty material: that would also suppress the `applied` event for a cohort request whose anchor/handle rows were its ONLY material — the case this ticket exists to make visible. Reader is pointed at `cf_structure_needs_disclosed` for the other question. |
