    13	// requestIDLogAttrs (CHAOS-3888) returns the "request_id" slog attribute
    14	// pair for ctx's observability request id, or nil when ctx carries none
    15	// (any caller not reached through the HTTP request-id middleware, e.g. most
    16	// existing unit tests) -- observability.RequestIDFromContext already
    17	// existed; nothing in this package read it before this ticket. Spread into
    18	// a log call via `attrs...` so a request-id-less ctx adds nothing to the
    19	// line rather than logging an empty string.
    20	func requestIDLogAttrs(ctx context.Context) []any {
