    37	// for the saved-call count, and hits / total for the rate. The non-hit
    38	// outcome values split WHY a call missed (authorization vs. evidence
    39	// containment vs. no candidate at all), so a cratered rate is
    40	// diagnosable from this one stream; see RecordAnswerReuse's doc comment
    41	// on EngineTelemetry.
