   156	## 3. Reversibility
   157	
   158	`EngineOptions.RegimeAOffersDisabled` (zero value = enabled) restores the
   159	window-only disclosure and skips the graph read entirely. The engine-side
   160	discard is the load-bearing safety layer; the ctx mark
   161	(`contextfabric.WithOffersOnlyResolution`) is a cost optimisation a
