    13	// CHAOS-4040 (sol-max ruling 2026-08-21, "GATE ALL INFERRED WINDOWS out of
    14	// decisive terminals"): every inferred (unconfirmed) evidence window --
    15	// both origins -- must be gated to a confirmation-required terminal before
    16	// it can influence a decisive answer. These tests pin the two gate call
    17	// sites (engine.go) and the reuse-side rejection (answer_reuse.go)
    18	// directly, at the contextfabric-package level, independent of the
    19	// two-turn harness's own broader acceptance run.
